  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Tech Compatibility**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the technology aspects, specifically the user\'s mention of \"NextJS+React.\" My platform uses Vite, React, and Express (Node server) in a Cloud Run container on port 3000. I need to ensure compatibility here, and am thinking through possible migration and/or integration paths. I am carefully weighing which technologies work best.\n\n\n**Evaluating Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'ve been examining Firebase integration. The user wants persistent data storage and Google Sign-In, so Firebase Auth and Firestore seem ideal. I\'m reviewing Firebase skills to ensure a seamless setup. I\'m also considering features like BMR/TDEE calculations with custom calorie targets, progress indicators, and weight logging with trend charts using recharts.\n\n\n**Assessing Dashboard Visualization**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user\'s need for a polished dashboard. I need to display summary metrics, charts, and nutritional breakdowns effectively, while supporting both light and dark themes. The aim is a modern UI, which should be easily navigable. I\'m also considering the saved food list and the water tracker features, ensuring they integrate seamlessly. I need to make sure the data is presented clearly.\n\n\n"
