  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Calorie Tracking**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the calorie logging app. My primary focus right now is on the user authentication aspect. The plan involves offering Google login for robust multi-user capabilities, with a seamless guest mode fallback that allows full database syncing upon login. I\'m prioritizing user experience throughout this process.\n\n\n**Refining Calorie Calculation**\n\nI\'ve moved on to the core calorie tracking features. My current thinking revolves around making the calorie intake calculation as user-friendly as possible. I\'m exploring two options: custom daily max calorie targets and automated BMR/TDEE calculation based on user input. I\'m prioritizing flexibility for the user in setting their targets.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 85571805
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
