  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning Application Architecture**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the React application using clean, modular TypeScript. The immediate goal is to establish the core application components and their relationships. I\'ve begun defining the data interfaces, starting with `/src/types.ts` and the `UserProfile` interface as a central starting point.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining key data structures. I\'ve fleshed out interfaces for gender, age, height, weight, activityLevel, bmr, tdee, customCalorieTarget, waterCupVolumeMl, waterDailyCupsTarget, and related logs (food, weight, water, and favorite foods), including fields like calories, serving information, and user IDs. Also, `ActivityLevel` is now typed as a union.\n\n\n\n**Calculating Nutritional Needs**\n\nI\'m now calculating BMR and TDEE with the Mifflin-St Jeor equation, accounting for gender. The app will support various activity levels to determine daily calorie needs.  I\'ve also devised calorie gap calculations, comparing consumed calories against BMR, TDEE, and custom goals. Finally, I\'ve got macros outlined as well.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n-`/src/components/Navbar.tsx`:\n-Top header with logo, user avatar, display name, Google Sign-in / Guest Sign-in button, date picker for selecting active tracking date, quick stats pills.\n\n-`/src/components/Dashboard.tsx`:\n-Main overview with high-level summary cards:\n-**Calorie\n\n**Designing Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the dashboard components. I\'ve broken down the design into several key elements. The calorie overview card will feature progress visuals against BMR and TDEE, with clear indicators of calorie gaps. I\'m also planning interactive macronutrient and water tracking widgets, and a weight input. Finally, I\'ve got a Quick Meal Log and a Food Log Section to create.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into feature-specific components. I\'m building a favorite food manager for quick logging. I\'ve also outlined weight and water trackers with interactive visualizations and settings. Finally, I\'m designing a user profile settings page to manage personal data. I\'m focusing on user-friendliness and efficient data entry.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 756285577
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
